+**Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
 *   **No Cameras See Points:** If all cameras are discarded because they see no sparse points, training fails [S3, unofficial].
-*   **Over-reconstruction:** Indicated by large positional gradients and large covariance. Handled by splitting [S2].
-*   **Under-reconstruction:** Indicated by large positional gradients but small covariance. Handled by cloning [S2].
+*   **Over-reconstruction:** Large positional gradients and large covariance indicate over-reconstruction, handled by splitting [S2].
+*   **Under-reconstruction:** Large positional gradients but small covariance indicate under-reconstruction, handled by cloning [S2].
